		(uuid "1fa1c596-d426-4081-adb2-c34ee1858d36")
	)
	(text "Dial board per spec §2a/§8. PEC11R 24 detents / 24 ppr with push switch (datasheet rev D04/26); shaft TBD in Phase 1.\nA/B: pull-ups are the core's internal ones (~13k, range unverified). 1k series + 10 nF to GND on the connector side:\nclosed-contact level ~0.24 V (< 0.3 VDD), discharge peak 3.3 mA (contact rating 10 mA at 5 V), rise ~0.2 ms vs >= 10 ms\nbetween edges at 60 RPM max. Bourns' own filter (10k pull-up, 10k, 10 nF) needs a supply J_DIAL does not carry.\nPush switch is a matrix key, col2row (ZMK: columns drive, rows read): SW_COL -> S1-S2 -> D901 anode -> cathode -> SW_ROW.\nMounting lugs (MP) to GND; lug-to-bushing continuity is not stated by Bourns. U901 TPD4E1U06 is a DNP footprint.\nJ_DIAL 1 SW_ROW, 2 ENC_A, 3 GND, 4 ENC_B, 5 SW_COL: end-reversed, A/B swap (direction) and the push diode\nreverses (press not seen); nothing is damaged. Bourns: hand soldering 'not recommended'; see the build guide."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 157.48 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			) (justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5114e109-98f9-4314-9aac-74322f697b20")
	)
